      "content": "but i've done this before where i just took a lot of ibuprofen and it worked fine, i really think i just overdid it with the lifting. the pain is constant but i don't feel nauseous or anything so i don't think it's an organ thing. i'm just trying to get through the weekend without spending hundreds on an urgent care visit. if i just take the 800mg every 6 hours and use a heating pad, is that really going to cause \"long term damage\"? it just feels like a really bad strain.",
